    "The inherited training candidate windows frequently lack complete original PCM support, especially Piper (509618/1500000 = 0.3397453333), but these positives are all overwritten before the network. These counts do not describe effective model inputs.",
    "The inherited long-prompt support difference does not support the proposed actual-network intervention because no inherited positive survives batch replacement.",
    "The older v40/v41 temporal support census is diagnostic only: it cannot establish current-model causality, and it does not authorize changing the gate.",
    "The original endpoint intervention was withdrawn at integration. Any future hypothesis must first identify effective network inputs; full-source support remains separate from target-phone timing."
